      "message": "[error] Line 746: 🔴 MID reuse is still position-based (`i` index) and only guarded by media type. This can assign the wrong MID when m-lines are reordered, when one of multiple same-type m-lines is removed, or when previously negotiated slots are skipped. In those cases browsers can remap transceivers incorrectly and reject/apply the re-offer unpredictably. Build a mapping from previous negotiated m-lines using a stable identity (existing MID/semantic track id) and apply it by identity, not by vector index.",
